    "old": "\\documentclass[11pt,a4paper]{article}\n\\usepackage[T1]{fontenc}\n\\usepackage[utf8]{inputenc}\n\\usepackage{lmodern,amsmath,amssymb,mathtools,mathrsfs,microtype}\n\\usepackage[margin=22mm]{geometry}\n\\usepackage{xcolor}\n\\usepackage[hidelinks]{hyperref}\n\\usepackage{bookmark,xurl}\n\\urlstyle{same}\n\\usepackage{fancyhdr}\n\\setlength{\\emergencystretch}{3em}\n\\setlength{\\headheight}{14pt}\n\\allowdisplaybreaks[2]\n\\pagestyle{fancy}\n\\fancyhf{}\n\\fancyhead[L]{\\small Holonomy descent and generator control}\n\\fancyfoot[C]{\\thepage}\n\\renewcommand{\\headrulewidth}{0.3pt}\n\\setcounter{tocdepth}{1}\n\\setcounter{secnumdepth}{-1}\n\\providecommand{\\tightlist}{\\setlength{\\itemsep}{0pt}\\setlength{\\parskip}{0pt}}\n\\hypersetup{\n pdftitle={Holonomy descent and generator control},\n pdfauthor={Split-Zero research programme},\n pdfsubject={Original holonomy quotient, exact relation cost and original-metric generator comparison}\n}\n\\title{Holonomy descent\\\\and generator control}\n\\author{Split-Zero research programme}\n\\date{13 September 2026}\n\\newcommand{\\C}{\\mathbb C}\n\\newcommand{\\R}{\\mathbb R}\n\\newcommand{\\av}{\\operatorname{av}}\n\\newcommand{\\im}{\\operatorname{im}}\n\\begin{document}\n\\maketitle\nThis companion retains the original holonomy source and coefficient frames,\nthe relation norm, the complete complex-parameter comparison and the\nresulting control of the original arithmetic generator.\nThe source note is reproduced in full; its H49c inverse domain is made\nprecise in HDI4--8. The completed-quotient calculations in CQ, HDI and\nHCD are retained as independent proofs of the same maps, with the\ncontinuous cochain construction and weighted relation cross term\nspelled out in HCD. The final CR proof gives the continuous-source\ncompletion and degree limit at the original fixed packet.\n\\tableofcontents\n\\clearpage\n\\part{All-holonomy descent of the original theta quotient}\n\\input{proofs/H.tex}\n\\clearpage\n\\part{Descent cost and generator control}\n\\input{proofs/HG.tex}\n\\clearpage\n\\input{proofs/HD.tex}\n\\clearpage\n\\part{Completed phase quotients and their full kernels}\n\\input{proofs/CQ.tex}\n\\clearpage\n\\part{Typed source addendum and sharp source realization}\n\\input{proofs/HDI.tex}\n\\clearpage\n\\part{Continuous common-image holonomy descent}\n\\noindent\\textit{Its contraction, metric gap, and completed receiving fibres}\n\\input{proofs/HCD.tex}\n\\clearpage\n\\part{Original continuous source and canonical degree limit}\n\\input{proofs/CR.tex}\n\\end{document}\n",
    "new": "\\documentclass[11pt,a4paper]{article}\n\\usepackage[T1]{fontenc}\n\\usepackage[utf8]{inputenc}\n\\usepackage{lmodern,amsmath,amssymb,mathtools,mathrsfs,microtype}\n\\usepackage[margin=22mm]{geometry}\n\\usepackage{xcolor}\n\\usepackage[hidelinks]{hyperref}\n\\usepackage{bookmark,xurl}\n\\urlstyle{same}\n\\usepackage{fancyhdr}\n\\setlength{\\emergencystretch}{3em}\n\\setlength{\\headheight}{14pt}\n\\allowdisplaybreaks[2]\n\\pagestyle{fancy}\n\\fancyhf{}\n\\fancyhead[L]{\\small Holonomy descent and generator control}\n\\fancyfoot[C]{\\thepage}\n\\renewcommand{\\headrulewidth}{0.3pt}\n\\setcounter{tocdepth}{1}\n\\setcounter{secnumdepth}{-1}\n\\providecommand{\\tightlist}{\\setlength{\\itemsep}{0pt}\\setlength{\\parskip}{0pt}}\n\\hypersetup{\n pdftitle={Holonomy descent and generator control},\n pdfauthor={Split-Zero research programme},\n pdfsubject={Original holonomy quotient, exact relation cost and original-metric generator comparison}\n}\n\\title{Holonomy descent\\\\and generator control}\n\\author{Split-Zero research programme}\n\\date{13 September 2026}\n\\newcommand{\\C}{\\mathbb C}\n\\newcommand{\\R}{\\mathbb R}\n\\newcommand{\\av}{\\operatorname{av}}\n\\newcommand{\\im}{\\operatorname{im}}\n\\begin{document}\n\\maketitle\nThis companion retains the original holonomy source and coefficient frames,\nthe relation norm, the complete complex-parameter comparison and the\nresulting control of the original arithmetic generator.\nThe source note is reproduced in full; its H49c inverse domain is made\nprecise in HDI4--8. The completed-quotient calculations in CQ, HDI and\nHCD are retained as independent proofs of the same maps, with the\ncontinuous cochain construction and weighted relation cross term\nspelled out in HCD. The final CR proof gives the continuous-source\ncompletion and degree limit at the original fixed packet.\n\\tableofcontents\n\\clearpage\n\\part{All-holonomy descent of the original theta quotient}\n\\input{proofs/H.tex}\n\\clearpage\n\\